==Strategy==
This stage is filled to the brim with [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien enemies]], meaning all you really need are [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien specialists]]. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] in particular can and will be an amazing asset to bring along to this stage, providing valuable crowd control and decent damage. Due to the presence of Youcan, a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker unit]] is recommended, however the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] should work fine. [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] can work as your only meatshields here due to their anti-Alien specialty.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibastra]]: Being able to deal Massive Damage and Weaken against Aliens, they are an amazing unit to bring. In addition, they can also break Barries, giving you more freedom with your choice of Cat Cannon. If you happen to own their Ultra Form, they makes this stage much easier.
*[[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizunade]] and [[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Ascendant Dioramos]]: Both of these units can Slow and Knockback Aliens, drastically reducing their pushing power. Adding on their ability to break barriers, it's clear that they're both excellent choices.
*[[The 9th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|The 9th Angel]] and [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Aphrodite]]: Both of these units are anti-Alien snipers with Massive Damage, their use here is straightforward, just keep them well protected so enemies won't push into their blindspots.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: With Strong and Freeze vs Aliens, she's a great pick for this stage, dealing both high DPS and reducing their pushing power. Plus, she Shields Youcan and Bun Bun Symbiotes' Waves.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Stratospheric Pathway]] stages, Burger Garden references American culture. Burgers have been an iconic food of the United States for [[wikipedia:History of the hamburger in the United States|many years]], while the abundance of [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] may allude to the stars on the U.S. flag.
*Burger Garden appears to have been designed specifically for [[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Aervantex]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] alongside [[Stratospheric Pathway]]. Aervantex is resistant to and knocks back all the [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] in the stage, is immune to the Warp abilities of [[Star Peng]] and [[Corporal Weyland]], and has a 100% chance to break [[Youcan]]'s [[Barrier]].

